{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015Ubg4Td4aN8DopP6ueWMUd","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。Gold validation 成为论文的杀手级证据：''Human annotations\n2\t  confirm that structural features detect genuine stagnation — the zero-shot advantage\n3\t  is not a circular artifact but reflects a real signal extraction efficiency gap.''\n4\t  Claim 1 用 gold F1 替代 LF F1 作为 headline number（稍低但 ground-truth validated），dominance\n5\t  claim 无需调整措辞。Circular evaluation 从 ''concern'' 降级为 ''caveat we addressed''。整体叙事从\n6\t  ''interesting finding with circularity caveat'' 升级为 ''gold-validated practical guidance''。EMNLP\n7\t  main 有竞争力。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: gold-set\n12\t  plan_id: gold-set\n13\t  description: 650 窗口人工标注（3 annotators, majority vote），评估所有方法在 ground-truth 上的真实性能\n14\t  expected_results:\n15\t    gold_n_windows: 650\n16\t    annotator_count: 3\n17\t    gold_kappa_fleiss: 0.82\n18\t    gold_kappa_pairwise_mean: 0.83\n19\t    gold_mv_agreement_rate: 0.92\n20\t    gold_stag_ratio: 0.29\n21\t    disagreement_windows: 52\n22\t    structural_rf_gold_macro_f1: 0.9438\n23\t    structural_rf_gold_f1_stag: 0.9187\n24\t    structural_rf_gold_f1_prog: 0.9689\n25\t    structural_gb_gold_macro_f1: 0.9485\n26\t    structural_gb_gold_f1_stag: 0.9253\n27\t    structural_gb_gold_f1_prog: 0.9717\n28\t    probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.8612\n29\t    probe_gold_f1_stag: 0.8034\n30\t    probe_gold_f1_prog: 0.919\n31\t    structural_gb_minus_probe_gold_pp: 8.73\n32\t    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.6891\n33\t    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.6203\n34\t    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.7579\n35\t    twv_probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.8549\n36\t    structural_gb_vs_llm_gold_pp: 25.94\n37\t    probe_vs_llm_gold_pp: 17.21\n38\t    gold_disagree_mv_n: 52\n39\t    gold_disagree_mv_probe_correct_pct: 0.38\n40\t    gold_disagree_mv_structural_correct_pct: 0.56\n41\t    structural_gb_gold_ci95_low: 0.9301\n42\t    structural_gb_gold_ci95_high: 0.9652\n43\t    probe_gold_ci95_low: 0.8329\n44\t    probe_gold_ci95_high: 0.8871\n45\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档假设 Gold 标注高度验证 MV 标签质量。κ=0.82 表明 annotators 在 stagnation\n46\t    判断上有 substantial agreement（SE 任务的 progress/stagnation 边界本身有主观性，但 window-level\n47\t    5-step 序列给了足够上下文让标注者达成一致）。92% gold-MV agreement 意味着 MV pipeline 在绝大多数窗口上产出了正确标签——8%\n48\t    的 disagreement 集中在 conf=1 的边界案例。\n49\t\n50\t    Structural features 在 gold 上的 F1 从 LF-eval 的 0.9951 降至 ~0.948，降幅 ~4.7pp， 这正是预期的：(1)\n51\t    structural features 部分通过 LF 输入特征逆向工程 LF 标签，失去这层 circular boost 后性能下降；(2) 但降幅很小，说明\n52\t    structural features 确实捕获了真实 stagnation 信号——不仅仅是 LF 逻辑的映射。0.948 在 650 个 ground-truth\n53\t    窗口上仍然是 近乎完美的检测能力。\n54\t\n55\t    Probe 在 gold 上的 F1=0.861 vs LF-eval 的 0.906 降 ~4.5pp，降幅类似。Probe 学到的 不完全是 LF 启发式，而是部分学到了真实语义信号。但\n56\t    structural 仍领先 probe 8.7pp， 证明 zero-shot dominance 在 ground truth 上成立。\n57\t\n58\t    LLM-judge 在 gold 上 0.689 vs LF-eval 的 0.663 微升 2.6pp——LLM 不受 circular eval 影响（本来就是独立评估），gold\n59\t    标签略偏向 LLM 的语义判断，合理。但仍远低于 structural 和 probe，效率差距在 ground truth 上得到验证。\n60\t\n61\t    Gold 与 MV disagreement 的 52 个窗口中 structural 有 56% 正确率（高于 probe 的 38%）， 进一步支持 structural\n62\t    features 检测的是真实停滞而非仅仅拟合 LF 规则。\n63\t\n64\t    '\n65\t  tables:\n66\t  - name: 'Table: Gold-Validated Method Comparison (N=650)'\n67\t    columns:\n68\t    - Method\n69\t    - Gold Macro-F1\n70\t    - Gold F1-stag\n71\t    - Gold F1-prog\n72\t    - LF-eval F1\n73\t    - Δ(Gold-LF)\n74\t    rows:\n75\t    - - Structural GB\n76\t      - '0.9485'\n77\t      - '0.9253'\n78\t      - '0.9717'\n79\t      - '0.9951'\n80\t      - -4.66pp\n81\t    - - Structural RF\n82\t      - '0.9438'\n83\t      - '0.9187'\n84\t      - '0.9689'\n85\t      - '0.9951'\n86\t      - -5.13pp\n87\t    - - GRU Probe (Qwen3)\n88\t      - '0.8612'\n89\t      - '0.8034'\n90\t      - '0.9190'\n91\t      - '0.9055'\n92\t      - -4.43pp\n93\t    - - LLM-judge (zero-shot)\n94\t      - '0.6891'\n95\t      - '0.6203'\n96\t      - '0.7579'\n97\t      - '0.6625'\n98\t      - +2.66pp\n99\t    - - TWV Probe\n100\t      - '0.8549'\n101\t      - '0.7941'\n102\t      - '0.9157'\n103\t      - 0.9003†\n104\t      - -4.54pp\n105\t  - name: 'Table: Inter-Annotator Agreement'\n106\t    columns:\n107\t    - Metric\n108\t    - Value\n109\t    rows:\n110\t    - - Fleiss' κ (3 annotators)\n111\t      - '0.82'\n112\t    - - Mean pairwise Cohen's κ\n113\t      - '0.83'\n114\t    - - Gold-MV agreement rate\n115\t      - 92.0%\n116\t    - - Disagreement windows\n117\t      - 52/650 (8.0%)\n118\t    - - Gold stag prevalence\n119\t      - 29.1%\n120\t  figures_description:\n121\t  - 'Fig: Scatter plot of gold labels vs MV labels (650 windows), color-coded by confidence\n122\t    level. conf≥2 windows show near-perfect agreement (96%+), conf=1 windows account\n123\t    for majority of disagreements.'\n124\t  - 'Fig: Bar chart comparing all methods on gold set with 95% bootstrap CIs. Clear\n125\t    separation: structural > probe > LLM-judge, with non-overlapping CIs between structural\n126\t    and probe.'\n127\t  - 'Fig: Confusion matrix of gold vs MV labels, annotated with per-cell probe/structural\n128\t    accuracy — shows structural captures gold-correct-MV-wrong cases better.'\n129\t  analysis: 'Gold validation 是论文从 ''interesting but circular'' 升级到 ''validated practical\n130\t    guidance'' 的关键。8.7pp structural-probe gap 在 gold 上保持，证明 zero-shot dominance 不是\n131\t    circular artifact。论文可以用 gold F1 作为 headline number（0.948 vs LF-eval 的 0.995），虽然绝对值\n132\t    略低但 ground-truth validated，reviewer 无法再 dismiss 为 circular。Circular evaluation\n133\t    concern 通过一组数据彻底关闭：(1) structural gold F1 仅降 4.7pp 说明绝大部分信号是真实的； (2) 即使在 gold-MV\n134\t    disagreement 的困难样本上 structural 仍优于 probe；(3) κ=0.82 证明 stagnation 本身是可靠标注的概念。\n135\t\n136\t    '\n137\t- name: llm-judge-fewshot\n138\t  plan_id: llm-judge-fewshot\n139\t  description: LLM-as-judge 加入 5-shot exemplars + chain-of-thought prompting，在 gold\n140\t    set 650 窗口上评估\n141\t  expected_results:\n142\t    model: claude-sonnet-4-6\n143\t    mode: 5-shot + CoT\n144\t    n_windows: 650\n145\t    gold_macro_f1: 0.7234\n146\t    gold_f1_stag: 0.6712\n147\t    gold_f1_prog: 0.7756\n148\t    gold_accuracy: 0.7369\n149\t    gold_precision_macro: 0.7518\n150\t    gold_recall_macro: 0.7102\n151\t    delta_vs_zeroshot_pp: 3.43\n152\t    structural_gb_advantage_pp: 22.51\n153\t    probe_advantage_pp: 13.78\n154\t    api_cost_usd: 18.92\n155\t    total_tokens: 4812000\n156\t    avg_latency_ms: 3200\n157\t    stag_recall: 0.6389\n158\t    stag_precision: 0.7081\n159\t    common_FN_pattern: diverse-action stagnation where steps look productive in isolation\n160\t    common_FP_pattern: repetitive but effective debugging loops\n161\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档中 LLM-judge fewshot 仍 ≤0.75。Few-shot + CoT 相比 zero-shot\n162\t    带来 ~3.4pp 提升 是合理的：exemplars 帮助 LLM 校准 stagnation 的 threshold（尤其是理解\"语义多样但无效\" 模式），CoT\n163\t    迫使 LLM 显式推理窗口内的进度而非逐步评估。但提升有限的原因：\n164\t\n165\t    (1) Stagnation 是 window-level 的集体属性——LLM 在 single-pass reading 中难以稳定 追踪 5 步之间的\n166\t    goal-directed coherence，few-shot 只教了\"什么算停滞\"但没教\"如何 系统性地追踪 progress across steps\"；\n167\t\n168\t    (2) LLM 的核心盲点在于 diverse-action stagnation（agent 做了编辑、运行、读文件等 多样操作，看起来 productive\n169\t    但实际没有推进 goal），这类模式即使有 exemplars 也很难 被 LLM 通过单次阅读识别——需要对比前后状态差异，而非仅读动作序列；\n170\t\n171\t    (3) CoT 增加了 token 开销 ~60%，但换来的准确率提升有限，因为 stagnation 判断的 bottleneck 不是\"推理不够\"而是\"信息提取不够\"——LLM\n172\t    需要的是结构化特征（文件变化频率、 命令重复率）而非更长的推理链。\n173\t\n174\t    0.723 仍大幅低于 structural 0.948（-22.5pp）和 probe 0.861（-13.8pp），效率差距 在 best-case LLM\n175\t    配置下依然显著。这验证了核心 claim：structural features 的优势 不是因为 LLM baseline 太弱，而是任务本质上更适合结构化特征提取。\n176\t\n177\t    '\n178\t  tables:\n179\t  - name: 'Table: LLM-as-Judge Variants on Gold Set'\n180\t    columns:\n181\t    - Configuration\n182\t    - Gold Macro-F1\n183\t    - F1-stag\n184\t    - F1-prog\n185\t    - Cost (USD)\n186\t    - Latency/window\n187\t    rows:\n188\t    - - Zero-shot\n189\t      - '0.6891'\n190\t      - '0.6203'\n191\t      - '0.7579'\n192\t      - $11.66†\n193\t      - ~2.1s\n194\t    - - 5-shot + CoT\n195\t      - '0.7234'\n196\t      - '0.6712'\n197\t      - '0.7756'\n198\t      - $18.92\n199\t      - ~3.2s\n200\t    - - Structural GB\n201\t      - '0.9485'\n202\t      - '0.9253'\n203\t      - '0.9717'\n204\t      - $0\n205\t      - <5ms\n206\t    - - GRU Probe\n207\t      - '0.8612'\n208\t      - '0.8034'\n209\t      - '0.9190'\n210\t      - $0\n211\t      - ~12ms\n212\t  - name: 'Table: Error Analysis — LLM Few-shot on Gold'\n213\t    columns:\n214\t    - Error Type\n215\t    - Count\n216\t    - '%'\n217\t    - Dominant Pattern\n218\t    rows:\n219\t    - - FP (predicted stag, gold prog)\n220\t      - '72'\n221\t      - 40.0%\n222\t      - Repetitive debugging loops that are actually effective\n223\t    - - FN (predicted prog, gold stag)\n224\t      - '108'\n225\t      - 60.0%\n226\t      - Diverse-action stagnation looking productive\n227\t  figures_description:\n228\t  - 'Fig: Radar chart comparing zero-shot vs few-shot LLM judge across 6 dimensions\n229\t    (precision-stag, recall-stag, precision-prog, recall-prog, cost-efficiency, latency).\n230\t    Few-shot improves recall-stag most (+4pp) but at 60% higher cost.'\n231\t  analysis: 'LLM-judge fewshot 的 0.723 为论文提供了 strongest possible LLM baseline。即使在\n232\t    few-shot + CoT 的最优配置下，structural features 仍领先 22.5pp，probe 仍领先 13.8pp。这消除了 \"zero-shot\n233\t    baseline 太弱\" 的 reviewer concern。论文可以 claim：\"Even with optimized prompting (5-shot\n234\t    + CoT), LLM-as-judge achieves only 0.723 F1 on gold-validated labels, 22.5pp below\n235\t    structural features — the efficiency gap is fundamental, not prompt-engineering\n236\t    addressable.\" Cost comparison 更 dramatic：$18.92 for 650 windows vs $0 for structural。\n237\t\n238\t    '\n239\t- name: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n240\t  plan_id: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n241\t  description: 从 30-dim structural vector 中移除所有与 LF 逻辑直接重叠的特征（cmd_rep 相关 ~8 features\n242\t    + file_diff 相关 ~6 features），仅保留 ~16 个非重叠特征，在 gold set 上评估残差 F1\n243\t  expected_results:\n244\t    total_features: 30\n245\t    removed_lf_overlap_features: 14\n246\t    remaining_non_overlap_features: 16\n247\t    removed_features_list:\n248\t    - cmd_rep_ratio\n249\t    - cmd_rep_max_consecutive\n250\t    - cmd_rep_unique_ratio\n251\t    - cmd_rep_entropy\n252\t    - cmd_rep_bigram_repeat\n253\t    - cmd_rep_last3_repeat\n254\t    - cmd_rep_pattern_score\n255\t    - cmd_rep_binary\n256\t    - file_diff_ratio\n257\t    - file_diff_count\n258\t    - file_diff_unique_files\n259\t    - file_diff_lines_changed\n260\t    - file_diff_binary\n261\t    - file_diff_entropy\n262\t    remaining_features_examples:\n263\t    - output_length_mean\n264\t    - output_length_std\n265\t    - step_duration_mean\n266\t    - error_rate\n267\t    - unique_commands\n268\t    - command_diversity\n269\t    - directory_changes\n270\t    - token_count_trend\n271\t    - action_type_entropy\n272\t    - response_length_ratio\n273\t    - edit_revert_ratio\n274\t    - tool_switch_rate\n275\t    - semantic_similarity_mean\n276\t    - output_novelty_score\n277\t    - goal_mention_rate\n278\t    - progress_keyword_ratio\n279\t    overlap_ablation_gold_rf_macro_f1: 0.8821\n280\t    overlap_ablation_gold_rf_f1_stag: 0.8412\n281\t    overlap_ablation_gold_rf_f1_prog: 0.923\n282\t    overlap_ablation_gold_gb_macro_f1: 0.8903\n283\t    overlap_ablation_gold_gb_f1_stag: 0.8534\n284\t    overlap_ablation_gold_gb_f1_prog: 0.9272\n285\t    residual_f1: 0.8903\n286\t    residual_f1_ci95_low: 0.8651\n287\t    residual_f1_ci95_high: 0.9127\n288\t    full_30_gold_gb_macro_f1: 0.9485\n289\t    delta_vs_full_pp: -5.82\n290\t    delta_vs_probe_pp: 2.91\n291\t    top3_remaining_importance:\n292\t    - output_novelty_score\n293\t    - action_type_entropy\n294\t    - edit_revert_ratio\n295\t    overlap_ablation_lf_eval_macro_f1: 0.9312\n296\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档要求 overlap ablation residual F1 ≥0.85。移除 14 个与 LF 直接重叠的特征后\n297\t    仍保持 0.890 的 gold F1，证明 structural signal 有独立于 LF 逻辑的信息贡献。\n298\t\n299\t    为什么残差 F1 高达 0.89：(1) 剩余 16 个特征（output novelty、action entropy、edit revert 等）捕获了\n300\t    stagnation 的\"行为指纹\"——停滞窗口不仅命令重复和文件不变，还 伴随 output 长度下降、行为多样性降低、工具切换频率下降等模式；(2) 这些特征虽然\n301\t    与 LF 逻辑无直接重叠，但与 stagnation 有 causal 关系——真正停滞的 agent 会在多个 维度同时表现出退化；(3) GB 的非线性组合能力让\n302\t    16 个弱特征的联合预测力接近 14 个 强特征的单独预测力。\n303\t\n304\t    降幅 5.8pp 是合理的：被移除的 14 个特征直接编码了 LF 的两个核心启发式（cmd_rep 和 file_diff），它们本身就是 stagnation\n305\t    的强信号。但 \"强信号被移除后仍有 0.89\" 正是关键论证——structural approach 的价值不仅在于重新发现 LF 逻辑，而在于捕获 LF\n306\t    未覆盖的补充维度。\n307\t\n308\t    Residual F1 0.89 > probe gold F1 0.86 (+2.9pp) 进一步强化了 structural approach 的优势论证：即使只用非\n309\t    LF-overlap 的特征，structural 仍 ≥ probe。\n310\t\n311\t    '\n312\t  tables:\n313\t  - name: 'Table: Overlap Ablation on Gold Set'\n314\t    columns:\n315\t    - Feature Set\n316\t    - N features\n317\t    - Gold Macro-F1\n318\t    - Gold F1-stag\n319\t    - Δ vs Full\n320\t    rows:\n321\t    - - Full structural\n322\t      - '30'\n323\t      - '0.9485'\n324\t      - '0.9253'\n325\t      - —\n326\t    - - Non-overlap only\n327\t      - '16'\n328\t      - '0.8903'\n329\t      - '0.8534'\n330\t      - -5.82pp\n331\t    - - LF-overlap only\n332\t      - '14'\n333\t      - '0.9289'\n334\t      - '0.9051'\n335\t      - -1.96pp\n336\t    - - GRU Probe (ref)\n337\t      - 1024-dim\n338\t      - '0.8612'\n339\t      - '0.8034'\n340\t      - -8.73pp\n341\t  - name: 'Table: Top Non-Overlap Feature Importances (GB, gold-evaluated)'\n342\t    columns:\n343\t    - Feature\n344\t    - Importance\n345\t    - Interpretation\n346\t    rows:\n347\t    - - output_novelty_score\n348\t      - '0.183'\n349\t      - Low novelty in outputs → stagnation\n350\t    - - action_type_entropy\n351\t      - '0.156'\n352\t      - Low action diversity → stagnation\n353\t    - - edit_revert_ratio\n354\t      - '0.134'\n355\t      - High revert rate → ineffective edits\n356\t    - - token_count_trend\n357\t      - '0.098'\n358\t      - Declining token use → disengagement\n359\t    - - tool_switch_rate\n360\t      - '0.087'\n361\t      - Low tool switching → stuck in one mode\n362\t  figures_description:\n363\t  - 'Fig: Venn diagram showing 3 signal sources: LF-overlap features (14), non-overlap\n364\t    structural (16), and probe embedding. Overlap region labeled with gold F1 for\n365\t    each combination.'\n366\t  - 'Fig: Feature importance heatmap for 16 non-overlap features, split by gold-stag\n367\t    vs gold-prog predictions. Shows complementary signal dimensions beyond LF logic.'\n368\t  analysis: 'Overlap ablation 是 circularity concern 的最终解答。Reviewer 可能 argue \"structural\n369\t    F1 高仅因为 features 直接编码了 LF 规则\"——ablation 证明即使移除所有 LF-overlap features，残差 F1=0.89\n370\t    仍然 (a) 远高于 random (0.50)，(b) 高于 probe (0.86)， (c) 在实用部署范围内。论文叙事：\"Even after removing\n371\t    all features that overlap with LF heuristics, the remaining 16 structural features\n372\t    achieve 0.89 F1 on gold — demonstrating that structural stagnation detection captures\n373\t    signal dimensions beyond what labeling functions encode.\" 这把 circular evaluation\n374\t    从 \"fatal flaw\" 变成 \"well-characterized and controlled confound\"。\n375\t\n376\t    '\n377\t- name: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n378\t  plan_id: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n379\t  description: 重新评估 cross-agent structural GB：确保 SWE-bench 训练集中无任何 instance 在 OH 测试集中出现（排除\n380\t    shared benchmark instances 的信息泄露）\n381\t  expected_results:\n382\t    swe_train_instances: 344\n383\t    oh_test_instances: 3394\n384\t    shared_benchmark_instances: 0\n385\t    note_on_sharing: SWE-Agent 和 OpenHands 使用不同的 SWE-bench split，无 instance 共享；但此实验确认\n386\t      structural features 不通过 problem-level 特征泄露\n387\t    isolation_method: 确保 structural feature 中无 instance-identifying 信息（如 repo name\n388\t      encoding、issue ID）。对 OH test 按 repo 分层评估排除 repo-level 泄露。\n389\t    gb_instance_isolated_macro_f1: 0.9612\n390\t    gb_instance_isolated_f1_stag: 0.9403\n391\t    gb_instance_isolated_f1_prog: 0.9821\n392\t    gb_seen_repos_macro_f1: 0.9687\n393\t    gb_unseen_repos_macro_f1: 0.9534\n394\t    gb_unseen_repos_delta_pp: -1.53\n395\t    gb_original_cross_agent_all: 0.9674\n396\t    delta_vs_original_pp: -0.62\n397\t    mcnemar_p_vs_original: 0.43\n398\t    bootstrap_ci95_low: 0.9498\n399\t    bootstrap_ci95_high: 0.9719\n400\t    probe_zeroshot_isolated_macro_f1: 0.5921\n401\t    structural_advantage_isolated_pp: 36.91\n402\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档要求 instance isolation 后 GB ≥0.95。预测 0.961 的理由：\n403\t\n404\t    (1) SWE-Agent 和 OpenHands 本身处理不同的 SWE-bench instances（不同 split）， 所以 instance-level\n405\t    信息泄露的风险本来就很低。Structural features（cmd_rep_ratio、 file_diff_count 等）是 agent 行为特征，不编码\n406\t    problem identity——一个 agent 在 处理任何 bug 时的停滞行为模式是相似的（重复命令、文件不变、输出不变），与具体 修什么 bug\n407\t    无关。\n408\t\n409\t    (2) 轻微降幅 0.62pp 来自 repo-level 的 minor distribution shift：某些 repo 的 代码结构可能导致 agent\n410\t    行为模式略有不同（如大型 monorepo vs 小型 library）， 但效应极小因为 structural features 在 abstraction\n411\t    level 上足够高——它们度量的是 行为模式（重复/变化/趋势）而非内容。\n412\t\n413\t    (3) Seen vs unseen repos 差距仅 1.5pp，证明 structural features 的跨域迁移不依赖 repo familiarity。这与\n414\t    structural features 的设计一致：它们度量的是 agent 行为 的 meta-patterns（是否在重复、是否在变化），完全独立于具体代码库。\n415\t\n416\t    (4) Probe 在 isolation 条件下几乎不变（0.592 vs 0.598），因为 probe 的 zero-shot failure 是 domain\n417\t    shift 问题而非泄露问题。Structural advantage 在 isolation 后 从 36.9pp 变为 36.9pp（几乎不变），进一步证明优势是真实的。\n418\t\n419\t    '\n420\t  tables:\n421\t  - name: 'Table: Instance Isolation Evaluation'\n422\t    columns:\n423\t    - Condition\n424\t    - GB Macro-F1\n425\t    - F1-stag\n426\t    - N windows\n427\t    - Δ vs Original\n428\t    rows:\n429\t    - - Original (all OH)\n430\t      - '0.9674'\n431\t      - '0.9479'\n432\t      - '150652'\n433\t      - —\n434\t    - - Instance-isolated\n435\t      - '0.9612'\n436\t      - '0.9403'\n437\t      - '150652'\n438\t      - -0.62pp\n439\t    - - — Seen repos only\n440\t      - '0.9687'\n441\t      - '0.9512'\n442\t      - '89432'\n443\t      - +0.13pp\n444\t    - - — Unseen repos only\n445\t      - '0.9534'\n446\t      - '0.9287'\n447\t      - '61220'\n448\t      - -1.53pp\n449\t  - name: 'Table: Isolation Impact on All Methods'\n450\t    columns:\n451\t    - Method\n452\t    - Original\n453\t    - Isolated\n454\t    - Δpp\n455\t    - McNemar p\n456\t    rows:\n457\t    - - Structural GB\n458\t      - '0.9674'\n459\t      - '0.9612'\n460\t      - '-0.62'\n461\t      - '0.43'\n462\t    - - Probe zero-shot\n463\t      - '0.5984'\n464\t      - '0.5921'\n465\t      - '-0.63'\n466\t      - '0.71'\n467\t    - - Advantage (struct-probe)\n468\t      - +36.90pp\n469\t      - +36.91pp\n470\t      - '+0.01'\n471\t      - —\n472\t  figures_description:\n473\t  - 'Fig: Box plot of per-repo structural GB F1 分布，split by seen/unseen repos. Both\n474\t    distributions concentrated above 0.93 with high overlap, confirming repo-independence.'\n475\t  - 'Fig: Scatter plot: x=repo size (LOC), y=GB F1 under isolation. No correlation\n476\t    (r=0.03), confirming features are scale-invariant.'\n477\t  analysis: Instance isolation 实验关闭了最后一个 data leakage concern。降幅仅 0.62pp 且 统计不显著（McNemar\n478\t    p=0.43），证明 structural GB 0.967 的 cross-agent 性能是 genuine transfer 而非 information\n479\t    leakage artifact。Unseen repos 上仅降 1.5pp 更进一步：即使 agent 面对全新代码库，structural stagnation\n480\t    detection 仍然有效。 论文可以 claim：\"Cross-agent transfer is robust to instance isolation\n481\t    (Δ=-0.62pp, p=0.43), confirming that structural features capture agent behavioral\n482\t    patterns independent of the specific problem being solved.\" 与 probe 的对比在 isolation\n483\t    条件下几乎完全不变（36.9pp），这是最干净的 dominance evidence。\n484\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd61a56a-c33f-4663-a970-94527a6602d7","uuid":"0b2f1b74-98a2-4f4e-85b0-1043e80a574f","timestamp":"2026-05-15T02:21:31.497Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T015115/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。Gold validation 成为论文的杀手级证据：''Human annotations\n  confirm that structural features detect genuine stagnation — the zero-shot advantage\n  is not a circular artifact but reflects a real signal extraction efficiency gap.''\n  Claim 1 用 gold F1 替代 LF F1 作为 headline number（稍低但 ground-truth validated），dominance\n  claim 无需调整措辞。Circular evaluation 从 ''concern'' 降级为 ''caveat we addressed''。整体叙事从\n  ''interesting finding with circularity caveat'' 升级为 ''gold-validated practical guidance''。EMNLP\n  main 有竞争力。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: gold-set\n  plan_id: gold-set\n  description: 650 窗口人工标注（3 annotators, majority vote），评估所有方法在 ground-truth 上的真实性能\n  expected_results:\n    gold_n_windows: 650\n    annotator_count: 3\n    gold_kappa_fleiss: 0.82\n    gold_kappa_pairwise_mean: 0.83\n    gold_mv_agreement_rate: 0.92\n    gold_stag_ratio: 0.29\n    disagreement_windows: 52\n    structural_rf_gold_macro_f1: 0.9438\n    structural_rf_gold_f1_stag: 0.9187\n    structural_rf_gold_f1_prog: 0.9689\n    structural_gb_gold_macro_f1: 0.9485\n    structural_gb_gold_f1_stag: 0.9253\n    structural_gb_gold_f1_prog: 0.9717\n    probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.8612\n    probe_gold_f1_stag: 0.8034\n    probe_gold_f1_prog: 0.919\n    structural_gb_minus_probe_gold_pp: 8.73\n    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.6891\n    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.6203\n    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.7579\n    twv_probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.8549\n    structural_gb_vs_llm_gold_pp: 25.94\n    probe_vs_llm_gold_pp: 17.21\n    gold_disagree_mv_n: 52\n    gold_disagree_mv_probe_correct_pct: 0.38\n    gold_disagree_mv_structural_correct_pct: 0.56\n    structural_gb_gold_ci95_low: 0.9301\n    structural_gb_gold_ci95_high: 0.9652\n    probe_gold_ci95_low: 0.8329\n    probe_gold_ci95_high: 0.8871\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档假设 Gold 标注高度验证 MV 标签质量。κ=0.82 表明 annotators 在 stagnation\n    判断上有 substantial agreement（SE 任务的 progress/stagnation 边界本身有主观性，但 window-level\n    5-step 序列给了足够上下文让标注者达成一致）。92% gold-MV agreement 意味着 MV pipeline 在绝大多数窗口上产出了正确标签——8%\n    的 disagreement 集中在 conf=1 的边界案例。\n\n    Structural features 在 gold 上的 F1 从 LF-eval 的 0.9951 降至 ~0.948，降幅 ~4.7pp， 这正是预期的：(1)\n    structural features 部分通过 LF 输入特征逆向工程 LF 标签，失去这层 circular boost 后性能下降；(2) 但降幅很小，说明\n    structural features 确实捕获了真实 stagnation 信号——不仅仅是 LF 逻辑的映射。0.948 在 650 个 ground-truth\n    窗口上仍然是 近乎完美的检测能力。\n\n    Probe 在 gold 上的 F1=0.861 vs LF-eval 的 0.906 降 ~4.5pp，降幅类似。Probe 学到的 不完全是 LF 启发式，而是部分学到了真实语义信号。但\n    structural 仍领先 probe 8.7pp， 证明 zero-shot dominance 在 ground truth 上成立。\n\n    LLM-judge 在 gold 上 0.689 vs LF-eval 的 0.663 微升 2.6pp——LLM 不受 circular eval 影响（本来就是独立评估），gold\n    标签略偏向 LLM 的语义判断，合理。但仍远低于 structural 和 probe，效率差距在 ground truth 上得到验证。\n\n    Gold 与 MV disagreement 的 52 个窗口中 structural 有 56% 正确率（高于 probe 的 38%）， 进一步支持 structural\n    features 检测的是真实停滞而非仅仅拟合 LF 规则。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Gold-Validated Method Comparison (N=650)'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Gold Macro-F1\n    - Gold F1-stag\n    - Gold F1-prog\n    - LF-eval F1\n    - Δ(Gold-LF)\n    rows:\n    - - Structural GB\n      - '0.9485'\n      - '0.9253'\n      - '0.9717'\n      - '0.9951'\n      - -4.66pp\n    - - Structural RF\n      - '0.9438'\n      - '0.9187'\n      - '0.9689'\n      - '0.9951'\n      - -5.13pp\n    - - GRU Probe (Qwen3)\n      - '0.8612'\n      - '0.8034'\n      - '0.9190'\n      - '0.9055'\n      - -4.43pp\n    - - LLM-judge (zero-shot)\n      - '0.6891'\n      - '0.6203'\n      - '0.7579'\n      - '0.6625'\n      - +2.66pp\n    - - TWV Probe\n      - '0.8549'\n      - '0.7941'\n      - '0.9157'\n      - 0.9003†\n      - -4.54pp\n  - name: 'Table: Inter-Annotator Agreement'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Value\n    rows:\n    - - Fleiss' κ (3 annotators)\n      - '0.82'\n    - - Mean pairwise Cohen's κ\n      - '0.83'\n    - - Gold-MV agreement rate\n      - 92.0%\n    - - Disagreement windows\n      - 52/650 (8.0%)\n    - - Gold stag prevalence\n      - 29.1%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scatter plot of gold labels vs MV labels (650 windows), color-coded by confidence\n    level. conf≥2 windows show near-perfect agreement (96%+), conf=1 windows account\n    for majority of disagreements.'\n  - 'Fig: Bar chart comparing all methods on gold set with 95% bootstrap CIs. Clear\n    separation: structural > probe > LLM-judge, with non-overlapping CIs between structural\n    and probe.'\n  - 'Fig: Confusion matrix of gold vs MV labels, annotated with per-cell probe/structural\n    accuracy — shows structural captures gold-correct-MV-wrong cases better.'\n  analysis: 'Gold validation 是论文从 ''interesting but circular'' 升级到 ''validated practical\n    guidance'' 的关键。8.7pp structural-probe gap 在 gold 上保持，证明 zero-shot dominance 不是\n    circular artifact。论文可以用 gold F1 作为 headline number（0.948 vs LF-eval 的 0.995），虽然绝对值\n    略低但 ground-truth validated，reviewer 无法再 dismiss 为 circular。Circular evaluation\n    concern 通过一组数据彻底关闭：(1) structural gold F1 仅降 4.7pp 说明绝大部分信号是真实的； (2) 即使在 gold-MV\n    disagreement 的困难样本上 structural 仍优于 probe；(3) κ=0.82 证明 stagnation 本身是可靠标注的概念。\n\n    '\n- name: llm-judge-fewshot\n  plan_id: llm-judge-fewshot\n  description: LLM-as-judge 加入 5-shot exemplars + chain-of-thought prompting，在 gold\n    set 650 窗口上评估\n  expected_results:\n    model: claude-sonnet-4-6\n    mode: 5-shot + CoT\n    n_windows: 650\n    gold_macro_f1: 0.7234\n    gold_f1_stag: 0.6712\n    gold_f1_prog: 0.7756\n    gold_accuracy: 0.7369\n    gold_precision_macro: 0.7518\n    gold_recall_macro: 0.7102\n    delta_vs_zeroshot_pp: 3.43\n    structural_gb_advantage_pp: 22.51\n    probe_advantage_pp: 13.78\n    api_cost_usd: 18.92\n    total_tokens: 4812000\n    avg_latency_ms: 3200\n    stag_recall: 0.6389\n    stag_precision: 0.7081\n    common_FN_pattern: diverse-action stagnation where steps look productive in isolation\n    common_FP_pattern: repetitive but effective debugging loops\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档中 LLM-judge fewshot 仍 ≤0.75。Few-shot + CoT 相比 zero-shot\n    带来 ~3.4pp 提升 是合理的：exemplars 帮助 LLM 校准 stagnation 的 threshold（尤其是理解\"语义多样但无效\" 模式），CoT\n    迫使 LLM 显式推理窗口内的进度而非逐步评估。但提升有限的原因：\n\n    (1) Stagnation 是 window-level 的集体属性——LLM 在 single-pass reading 中难以稳定 追踪 5 步之间的\n    goal-directed coherence，few-shot 只教了\"什么算停滞\"但没教\"如何 系统性地追踪 progress across steps\"；\n\n    (2) LLM 的核心盲点在于 diverse-action stagnation（agent 做了编辑、运行、读文件等 多样操作，看起来 productive\n    但实际没有推进 goal），这类模式即使有 exemplars 也很难 被 LLM 通过单次阅读识别——需要对比前后状态差异，而非仅读动作序列；\n\n    (3) CoT 增加了 token 开销 ~60%，但换来的准确率提升有限，因为 stagnation 判断的 bottleneck 不是\"推理不够\"而是\"信息提取不够\"——LLM\n    需要的是结构化特征（文件变化频率、 命令重复率）而非更长的推理链。\n\n    0.723 仍大幅低于 structural 0.948（-22.5pp）和 probe 0.861（-13.8pp），效率差距 在 best-case LLM\n    配置下依然显著。这验证了核心 claim：structural features 的优势 不是因为 LLM baseline 太弱，而是任务本质上更适合结构化特征提取。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: LLM-as-Judge Variants on Gold Set'\n    columns:\n    - Configuration\n    - Gold Macro-F1\n    - F1-stag\n    - F1-prog\n    - Cost (USD)\n    - Latency/window\n    rows:\n    - - Zero-shot\n      - '0.6891'\n      - '0.6203'\n      - '0.7579'\n      - $11.66†\n      - ~2.1s\n    - - 5-shot + CoT\n      - '0.7234'\n      - '0.6712'\n      - '0.7756'\n      - $18.92\n      - ~3.2s\n    - - Structural GB\n      - '0.9485'\n      - '0.9253'\n      - '0.9717'\n      - $0\n      - <5ms\n    - - GRU Probe\n      - '0.8612'\n      - '0.8034'\n      - '0.9190'\n      - $0\n      - ~12ms\n  - name: 'Table: Error Analysis — LLM Few-shot on Gold'\n    columns:\n    - Error Type\n    - Count\n    - '%'\n    - Dominant Pattern\n    rows:\n    - - FP (predicted stag, gold prog)\n      - '72'\n      - 40.0%\n      - Repetitive debugging loops that are actually effective\n    - - FN (predicted prog, gold stag)\n      - '108'\n      - 60.0%\n      - Diverse-action stagnation looking productive\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Radar chart comparing zero-shot vs few-shot LLM judge across 6 dimensions\n    (precision-stag, recall-stag, precision-prog, recall-prog, cost-efficiency, latency).\n    Few-shot improves recall-stag most (+4pp) but at 60% higher cost.'\n  analysis: 'LLM-judge fewshot 的 0.723 为论文提供了 strongest possible LLM baseline。即使在\n    few-shot + CoT 的最优配置下，structural features 仍领先 22.5pp，probe 仍领先 13.8pp。这消除了 \"zero-shot\n    baseline 太弱\" 的 reviewer concern。论文可以 claim：\"Even with optimized prompting (5-shot\n    + CoT), LLM-as-judge achieves only 0.723 F1 on gold-validated labels, 22.5pp below\n    structural features — the efficiency gap is fundamental, not prompt-engineering\n    addressable.\" Cost comparison 更 dramatic：$18.92 for 650 windows vs $0 for structural。\n\n    '\n- name: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n  plan_id: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n  description: 从 30-dim structural vector 中移除所有与 LF 逻辑直接重叠的特征（cmd_rep 相关 ~8 features\n    + file_diff 相关 ~6 features），仅保留 ~16 个非重叠特征，在 gold set 上评估残差 F1\n  expected_results:\n    total_features: 30\n    removed_lf_overlap_features: 14\n    remaining_non_overlap_features: 16\n    removed_features_list:\n    - cmd_rep_ratio\n    - cmd_rep_max_consecutive\n    - cmd_rep_unique_ratio\n    - cmd_rep_entropy\n    - cmd_rep_bigram_repeat\n    - cmd_rep_last3_repeat\n    - cmd_rep_pattern_score\n    - cmd_rep_binary\n    - file_diff_ratio\n    - file_diff_count\n    - file_diff_unique_files\n    - file_diff_lines_changed\n    - file_diff_binary\n    - file_diff_entropy\n    remaining_features_examples:\n    - output_length_mean\n    - output_length_std\n    - step_duration_mean\n    - error_rate\n    - unique_commands\n    - command_diversity\n    - directory_changes\n    - token_count_trend\n    - action_type_entropy\n    - response_length_ratio\n    - edit_revert_ratio\n    - tool_switch_rate\n    - semantic_similarity_mean\n    - output_novelty_score\n    - goal_mention_rate\n    - progress_keyword_ratio\n    overlap_ablation_gold_rf_macro_f1: 0.8821\n    overlap_ablation_gold_rf_f1_stag: 0.8412\n    overlap_ablation_gold_rf_f1_prog: 0.923\n    overlap_ablation_gold_gb_macro_f1: 0.8903\n    overlap_ablation_gold_gb_f1_stag: 0.8534\n    overlap_ablation_gold_gb_f1_prog: 0.9272\n    residual_f1: 0.8903\n    residual_f1_ci95_low: 0.8651\n    residual_f1_ci95_high: 0.9127\n    full_30_gold_gb_macro_f1: 0.9485\n    delta_vs_full_pp: -5.82\n    delta_vs_probe_pp: 2.91\n    top3_remaining_importance:\n    - output_novelty_score\n    - action_type_entropy\n    - edit_revert_ratio\n    overlap_ablation_lf_eval_macro_f1: 0.9312\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档要求 overlap ablation residual F1 ≥0.85。移除 14 个与 LF 直接重叠的特征后\n    仍保持 0.890 的 gold F1，证明 structural signal 有独立于 LF 逻辑的信息贡献。\n\n    为什么残差 F1 高达 0.89：(1) 剩余 16 个特征（output novelty、action entropy、edit revert 等）捕获了\n    stagnation 的\"行为指纹\"——停滞窗口不仅命令重复和文件不变，还 伴随 output 长度下降、行为多样性降低、工具切换频率下降等模式；(2) 这些特征虽然\n    与 LF 逻辑无直接重叠，但与 stagnation 有 causal 关系——真正停滞的 agent 会在多个 维度同时表现出退化；(3) GB 的非线性组合能力让\n    16 个弱特征的联合预测力接近 14 个 强特征的单独预测力。\n\n    降幅 5.8pp 是合理的：被移除的 14 个特征直接编码了 LF 的两个核心启发式（cmd_rep 和 file_diff），它们本身就是 stagnation\n    的强信号。但 \"强信号被移除后仍有 0.89\" 正是关键论证——structural approach 的价值不仅在于重新发现 LF 逻辑，而在于捕获 LF\n    未覆盖的补充维度。\n\n    Residual F1 0.89 > probe gold F1 0.86 (+2.9pp) 进一步强化了 structural approach 的优势论证：即使只用非\n    LF-overlap 的特征，structural 仍 ≥ probe。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Overlap Ablation on Gold Set'\n    columns:\n    - Feature Set\n    - N features\n    - Gold Macro-F1\n    - Gold F1-stag\n    - Δ vs Full\n    rows:\n    - - Full structural\n      - '30'\n      - '0.9485'\n      - '0.9253'\n      - —\n    - - Non-overlap only\n      - '16'\n      - '0.8903'\n      - '0.8534'\n      - -5.82pp\n    - - LF-overlap only\n      - '14'\n      - '0.9289'\n      - '0.9051'\n      - -1.96pp\n    - - GRU Probe (ref)\n      - 1024-dim\n      - '0.8612'\n      - '0.8034'\n      - -8.73pp\n  - name: 'Table: Top Non-Overlap Feature Importances (GB, gold-evaluated)'\n    columns:\n    - Feature\n    - Importance\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - output_novelty_score\n      - '0.183'\n      - Low novelty in outputs → stagnation\n    - - action_type_entropy\n      - '0.156'\n      - Low action diversity → stagnation\n    - - edit_revert_ratio\n      - '0.134'\n      - High revert rate → ineffective edits\n    - - token_count_trend\n      - '0.098'\n      - Declining token use → disengagement\n    - - tool_switch_rate\n      - '0.087'\n      - Low tool switching → stuck in one mode\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Venn diagram showing 3 signal sources: LF-overlap features (14), non-overlap\n    structural (16), and probe embedding. Overlap region labeled with gold F1 for\n    each combination.'\n  - 'Fig: Feature importance heatmap for 16 non-overlap features, split by gold-stag\n    vs gold-prog predictions. Shows complementary signal dimensions beyond LF logic.'\n  analysis: 'Overlap ablation 是 circularity concern 的最终解答。Reviewer 可能 argue \"structural\n    F1 高仅因为 features 直接编码了 LF 规则\"——ablation 证明即使移除所有 LF-overlap features，残差 F1=0.89\n    仍然 (a) 远高于 random (0.50)，(b) 高于 probe (0.86)， (c) 在实用部署范围内。论文叙事：\"Even after removing\n    all features that overlap with LF heuristics, the remaining 16 structural features\n    achieve 0.89 F1 on gold — demonstrating that structural stagnation detection captures\n    signal dimensions beyond what labeling functions encode.\" 这把 circular evaluation\n    从 \"fatal flaw\" 变成 \"well-characterized and controlled confound\"。\n\n    '\n- name: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n  plan_id: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n  description: 重新评估 cross-agent structural GB：确保 SWE-bench 训练集中无任何 instance 在 OH 测试集中出现（排除\n    shared benchmark instances 的信息泄露）\n  expected_results:\n    swe_train_instances: 344\n    oh_test_instances: 3394\n    shared_benchmark_instances: 0\n    note_on_sharing: SWE-Agent 和 OpenHands 使用不同的 SWE-bench split，无 instance 共享；但此实验确认\n      structural features 不通过 problem-level 特征泄露\n    isolation_method: 确保 structural feature 中无 instance-identifying 信息（如 repo name\n      encoding、issue ID）。对 OH test 按 repo 分层评估排除 repo-level 泄露。\n    gb_instance_isolated_macro_f1: 0.9612\n    gb_instance_isolated_f1_stag: 0.9403\n    gb_instance_isolated_f1_prog: 0.9821\n    gb_seen_repos_macro_f1: 0.9687\n    gb_unseen_repos_macro_f1: 0.9534\n    gb_unseen_repos_delta_pp: -1.53\n    gb_original_cross_agent_all: 0.9674\n    delta_vs_original_pp: -0.62\n    mcnemar_p_vs_original: 0.43\n    bootstrap_ci95_low: 0.9498\n    bootstrap_ci95_high: 0.9719\n    probe_zeroshot_isolated_macro_f1: 0.5921\n    structural_advantage_isolated_pp: 36.91\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档要求 instance isolation 后 GB ≥0.95。预测 0.961 的理由：\n\n    (1) SWE-Agent 和 OpenHands 本身处理不同的 SWE-bench instances（不同 split）， 所以 instance-level\n    信息泄露的风险本来就很低。Structural features（cmd_rep_ratio、 file_diff_count 等）是 agent 行为特征，不编码\n    problem identity——一个 agent 在 处理任何 bug 时的停滞行为模式是相似的（重复命令、文件不变、输出不变），与具体 修什么 bug\n    无关。\n\n    (2) 轻微降幅 0.62pp 来自 repo-level 的 minor distribution shift：某些 repo 的 代码结构可能导致 agent\n    行为模式略有不同（如大型 monorepo vs 小型 library）， 但效应极小因为 structural features 在 abstraction\n    level 上足够高——它们度量的是 行为模式（重复/变化/趋势）而非内容。\n\n    (3) Seen vs unseen repos 差距仅 1.5pp，证明 structural features 的跨域迁移不依赖 repo familiarity。这与\n    structural features 的设计一致：它们度量的是 agent 行为 的 meta-patterns（是否在重复、是否在变化），完全独立于具体代码库。\n\n    (4) Probe 在 isolation 条件下几乎不变（0.592 vs 0.598），因为 probe 的 zero-shot failure 是 domain\n    shift 问题而非泄露问题。Structural advantage 在 isolation 后 从 36.9pp 变为 36.9pp（几乎不变），进一步证明优势是真实的。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Instance Isolation Evaluation'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - GB Macro-F1\n    - F1-stag\n    - N windows\n    - Δ vs Original\n    rows:\n    - - Original (all OH)\n      - '0.9674'\n      - '0.9479'\n      - '150652'\n      - —\n    - - Instance-isolated\n      - '0.9612'\n      - '0.9403'\n      - '150652'\n      - -0.62pp\n    - - — Seen repos only\n      - '0.9687'\n      - '0.9512'\n      - '89432'\n      - +0.13pp\n    - - — Unseen repos only\n      - '0.9534'\n      - '0.9287'\n      - '61220'\n      - -1.53pp\n  - name: 'Table: Isolation Impact on All Methods'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Original\n    - Isolated\n    - Δpp\n    - McNemar p\n    rows:\n    - - Structural GB\n      - '0.9674'\n      - '0.9612'\n      - '-0.62'\n      - '0.43'\n    - - Probe zero-shot\n      - '0.5984'\n      - '0.5921'\n      - '-0.63'\n      - '0.71'\n    - - Advantage (struct-probe)\n      - +36.90pp\n      - +36.91pp\n      - '+0.01'\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Box plot of per-repo structural GB F1 分布，split by seen/unseen repos. Both\n    distributions concentrated above 0.93 with high overlap, confirming repo-independence.'\n  - 'Fig: Scatter plot: x=repo size (LOC), y=GB F1 under isolation. No correlation\n    (r=0.03), confirming features are scale-invariant.'\n  analysis: Instance isolation 实验关闭了最后一个 data leakage concern。降幅仅 0.62pp 且 统计不显著（McNemar\n    p=0.43），证明 structural GB 0.967 的 cross-agent 性能是 genuine transfer 而非 information\n    leakage artifact。Unseen repos 上仅降 1.5pp 更进一步：即使 agent 面对全新代码库，structural stagnation\n    detection 仍然有效。 论文可以 claim：\"Cross-agent transfer is robust to instance isolation\n    (Δ=-0.62pp, p=0.43), confirming that structural features capture agent behavioral\n    patterns independent of the specific problem being solved.\" 与 probe 的对比在 isolation\n    条件下几乎完全不变（36.9pp），这是最干净的 dominance evidence。\n","numLines":484,"startLine":1,"totalLines":484}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01XLGBKvi9ipWbyqVZfA1UAD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've now read the full paper (8 pages) and the review context YAML. Let me now dispatch the two reviewers in parallel for Step 1 (independent reviews).\n\nLet me summarize what I have:\n\n**Paper**: \"Structural Features Dominate Zero-Shot Cross-Agent Stagnation Detection: A Gold-Validated Empirical Study\"\n\n**Key claims**:\n1. 30 structural features achieve 0.948 gold F1, outperforming GRU probe (0.861) and LLM judge (0.689/0.723)\n\n\n2. The efficiency gap with LLMs appears fundamental—even few-shot prompting only reaches 0.723\n3. Ablating non-overlapping features still maintains 0.890 gold F1, indicating the signal extends beyond simple circularity in the labeling function\n\n**Experiments in paper**: Gold validation (Table 1-2), LLM few-shot (Table 3-4), Overlap ablation (Table 5-6), Instance isolation (Table 7-8)\n\n**Review context (imagined experiments)**: gold-set, llm-judge-fewshot, structural-feature-overlap-ablation, cross-agent-instance-isolation\n\nThe paper covers all 4 imagined experiments, so coverage looks solid.\n\nNow I'm setting up the reviewer assignments—I'll have R1 focus on methods and experiments while R2 handles novelty and related work, running these in parallel as the first step of the roundtable discussion. I need to be careful not to signal any quality tiers when framing the tasks.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":29041,"cache_read_input_tokens":23475,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":29041},"output_tokens":18,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd61a56a-c33f-4663-a970-94527a6602d7","uuid":"0a5bd427-72c9-4cfb-a89d-a5ab